t hair are white color, not pink. And the inner back part of her hair is also white color. Full details are in the folder.\n-Please include her tail(s), either one or multiple is okay. Separate it in different layer if possible, but it's not necessary.\n-Her eye color is light mint color.\n\nCould you please draw the pose and facial expression similar to this? Heart eyes and lip lickings. She looks very sexy and seductive. Intimate atmosphere. I'd love a few facial expressions if possible, but it's totally okay if not! I'd like to use it for social medias.\nhttps://skeb.jp/@_eneanea_/works/4\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12oYDPCvbXHwu_Dn_31z_21EyONcVSq7f", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@_eneanea_/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2804150, "client_id": 3313385, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/77d1c49a/uploads/origins/8746cb07-ad96-46f7-8855-b698da85b83b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=986ba4f6ba26a5a70bd93e7e3d2f641c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/77d1c49a/uploads/origins/8746cb07-ad96-46f7-8855-b698da85b83b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=986ba4f6ba26a5a70bd93e7e3d2f641c, https://si.imgix.net/77d1c49a/uploads/origins/8746cb07-ad96-46f7-8855-b698da85b83b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7875db06802804844c099ffc6744a43f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/77d1c49a/uploads/origins/8746cb07-ad96-46f7-8855-b698da85b83b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ca6eb2fd054175ca0525ce0cb430c8b6 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/77d1c49a/uploads/origins/8746cb07-ad96-46f7-8855-b698da85b83b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=cr